<title>USA: Consolidated Natural Gas Co Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Natural Gas Co Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.93		    $0.94</p>
<p> Net			 87,974		   87,467</p>
<p> Revs		   1,229,218		  935,574</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  94,882		   93,442</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.16		    $0.23</p>
<p> Net			298,273		   21,344</p>
<p> Revs		   3,794,309		3,307,325</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  94,434		   93,246</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 includes a charge of $7.8 million, or $0.08 a share, related to workforce reductions.</p>
<p>1996 year includes $9.9 million, or $0.10 a share, in charges related to job cuts.</p>
<p>1995 year includes charges of $145 million, or $1.56 a share from write-down of oil and gas properties; $25.6 million or $0.27 a share from job cuts; and a write-down of coal properties or $20.3 million, or $0.22 a share.</p>
<p>Q4 operating earnings per share excluding charges totaled $1.01 vs $0.94.</p>
<p>Year operating earnings per share excluding charges $3.26 vs $2.28.</p>
</text>
